      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BURRINGBAR REBEL (1) hit the frame last time at this track but just a few starts ago ran blistering time when scoring over 457m at Q Lakeside in 25.14. Has the ability and looks a key chance again. SWIFT GRANT (3) has been in super consistent form recently with two minors on end before missing the frame latest finishing fourth (23.62) at this track. Form at the trip sound including seven wins. Goes well out of this box with a win and three minor placings. Cannot be left out. STRIPED MAC (8) turned in a better run last time to find a minor placing (23.93) at this track behind Needle And Seat in a Grade 5. Has the pace to be prominent. Will give a great sight again. SHUFFLE (2) hit the frame latest (16.85) when second at this track in a NG. Already a winner from this draw.",
